### Get region status by UUID
GET http://localhost:8080/orch/api/regions/5370f50e-c5ca-4247-bc18-11de1fa2bfdd/status

### Get region status (localhost) - Example UUID
# GET http://localhost:8081/orch/api/regions/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/status

### Expected response:
# {
#   "region_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
#   "status": "Done",  // or NotStarted, FetchQueued, Fetching, etc.
#   "last_fetch_at": "2026-02-15T10:30:00Z",
#   "last_summary_at": "2026-02-15T10:35:00Z",
#   "summary_count": 3,
#   "current_priority": null
# }
